data: {"id": "aea25602f4f24d3e-thinking-parallel_evidence-915", "run_id": "aea25602f4f24d3e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "kubectl 未注册 `networkattachmentdefinition` 这种 CRD 类型，说明集群中可能没有安装 Multus CNI 的 CRD，或者该 CRD 未被当前 kubectl 上下文支持。不过从 `describe` 输出来看，Pod 确实引用了 `unavailable-network` 且事件明确报告 `NoNetworkFound`。\n\n再检查下 Events 是否有更多上下文：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789057762016, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

