data: {"id": "aea25602f4f24d3e-final", "run_id": "aea25602f4f24d3e", "seq": 1471, "ts_ms": 1789057796741, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh 的 Multus CNI 插件引用了名为 'unavailable-network' 的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition，但该 CR 在命名空间 aiops-case-05 中不存在，导致 CNI 无法创建 Pod 网络沙箱，Pod 持续处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` (ns: `aiops-case-05`) 状态 `Pending` / 容器状态 `ContainerCreating` | 确认 Pod 处于启动阻塞状态，未进入运行阶段 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: kubelet 报错 `failed to setup network for sandbox`: Multus plugin 失败 | 直接反映 CNI 插件在创建网络沙箱时发生错误 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `NoNetworkFound`: Multus 报错 `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): ... \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 精确定位网络配置缺失，明确缺失对象的名称和命名空间 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | 容器 `app` 存在注解引用 `cni.projectcalico.org/networks: unavailable-network` | 证实 Pod 定义中显式配置了该不存在的网络，是引发上述报错的直接原因 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 `1`，标签 `reason=ContainerCreating` | 从监控维度印证容器长期停留在等待创建状态 |\n\n**证据小结：**\nKubernetes 事件 (`fact-06ff1146fc23`, `fact-ad76d73b8759`) 明确指出 Pod 无法创建网络沙箱是因为找不到名为 `unavailable-network` 的 `network-attachment-definition`，结合 Pod 注解事实 (`fact-0fc63cb437b8`)，确认该网络配置存在于 Pod 定义中但关联资源缺失，直接阻断了 Pod 的启动流程。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 定义引用了不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' (证据 4)\n  → Multus CNI 插件加载网络配置失败并报错 'not found' (证据 3)\n  → Kubelet 无法为 Pod 创建网络沙箱 (证据 2)\n  → Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态，容器停留在 ContainerCreating (证据 1)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：**\nPod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh` 配置了 Multus CNI 插件，并引用了名为 `unavailable-network` 的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition`。由于该资源在命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中不存在，Multus 插件无法初始化网络，导致 Pod 的 CNI 配置阶段失败，Pod 持续卡在 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态。\n\n**证据支撑：**\n1.  **网络报错**：`NoNetworkFound` 事件（如 `fact-06ff1146fc23`）直接报错找不到指定的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition。\n2.  **配置关联**：Kubernetes 事实（如 `fact-0fc63cb437b8`）证实 Pod 内部确实配置了该网络引用。\n3.  **状态阻塞**：Pod 状态（证据 1）和等待指标（证据 5）证实问题持续存在，无重启恢复迹象。\n\n**未确认事项：**\n输入中的 `unknowns` 提到了该引用是拼写错误还是确实遗漏创建，以及是否影响其他 Pod。当前事实已证实“引用缺失导致阻塞”这一故障现象，但关于引用本身的修正意图（如正确名称是什么）需要人工核对。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 49.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh: 49.0s (Evidence 40.2s, RCA 8.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-bntfh**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 76.793, "metrics": {"run_id": "aea25602f4f24d3e", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 76.79751014709473, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 76797.51014709473, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 63276.38292312622, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 22020.068407058716, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 13129.35733795166}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15286.459922790527, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 48976.78732872009, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 12510.058641433716, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

